# 🏥 Healthcare ML Dashboard

## 📌 Overview
A machine learning web application that analyzes healthcare datasets and predicts disease outcomes.

## 🚀 Features
- CSV/Excel upload
- Data preprocessing
- Model training & prediction
- Interactive charts
- PDF report generation
- Authentication system

## 🛠 Tech Stack
- Python
- Flask
- Pandas
- Scikit-learn
- SQLite
- Chart.js

## 📊 Model Performance
Accuracy: 87%
Precision: 85%
Recall: 83%

## ⚙️ Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/healthcare-ml-dashboard.git
cd healthcare-ml-dashboard
pip install -r requirements.txt
python app.py
